msgstr "解除限制至本期结束"

msgid "Resume automatic limiting"
msgstr "恢复自动限制"

msgid "Initializing monthly statistics…"
msgstr "月流量统计初始化中…"

msgid "Period %s to %s (exclusive) · Download %s / Upload %s / Total %s"
msgstr "本期 %s 至 %s（不含结束日） · 下载 %s / 上传 %s / 合计 %s"

msgid " · Quota %s / Remaining %s / Used %s%%"
msgstr " · 额度 %s / 剩余 %s / 已用 %s%%"

msgid "Quota limit is not enabled"
msgstr "未开启额度限制"

msgid "Online normally; throttled after %s%%, WAN paused at 100%%"
msgstr "正常联网；达到 %s%% 后限速，100%% 暂停 WAN"

msgid "Throttled: download %s Mbps / upload %s Mbps"
msgstr "已限速：下载 %s Mbps / 上传 %s Mbps"

msgid "Quota reached; WAN access paused, LAN management still available"
msgstr "已达到额度，WAN 联网暂停；局域网管理可用"

msgid "Limit lifted for this period; resumes automatically next billing cycle"
msgstr "本期限制已解除，下个账单周期自动恢复"

msgid "Rules did not take effect: %s"
msgstr "规则未正常生效：%s"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"

msgid "Updating status…"
msgstr "状态更新中"

msgid "Unlock for this period"
msgstr "解除本期限制"

msgid "Lift throttling and blocking immediately until the end of this period. Traffic keeps accumulating; overage may incur carrier charges."
msgstr "立即解除限速和断网，直到本期结束。流量仍继续累计；超额可能产生运营商费用。"

msgid "Re-apply quota throttling or blocking immediately; if usage already reached 100%, WAN access will be paused."
msgstr "立即重新按额度执行限速或断网；如果已达到 100%，WAN 将暂停联网。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Operation failed: %s"
msgstr "操作失败：%s"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "Monthly Traffic & Quota"
msgstr "月流量与额度控制"

msgid "Only recorded traffic is counted and may differ from carrier billing; billing day and quota can be adjusted on the settings page."
msgstr "仅统计已采集流量，与运营商计费可能存在偏差；账单周期和额度可在设置页调整。"

msgid "Monitoring time range"
msgstr "监控时间范围"

msgid "Network latency (Aliyun green / Tencent blue)"
msgstr "网络延迟（阿里绿 / 腾讯蓝）"

msgid "System usage (CPU red / memory purple)"
msgstr "系统使用率（CPU 红 / 内存紫）"

msgid "Device temperature and fan (CPU red / Wi-Fi blue / modem orange / fan green)"
msgstr "设备温度与风扇（CPU 红 / Wi-Fi 蓝 / 模组橙 / 风扇绿）"

msgid "5G signal (RSRP red / RSRQ orange / SINR green)"
msgstr "5G 信号（RSRP 红 / RSRQ 橙 / SINR 绿）"

msgid "Daily traffic trend"
msgstr "每日流量趋势"

msgid "Daily traffic details"
msgstr "每日流量明细"

msgid "Memory"
msgstr "内存"

msgid "Modem"
msgstr "模组"

msgid "Fan"
msgstr "风扇"

msgid "Aliyun"
msgstr "阿里云"

msgid "Tencent"
msgstr "腾讯云"

msgid "No data for the selected period"
msgstr "所选时间段暂无数据"

msgid "Up/down throughput"
msgstr "上下行速率"

msgid "Download (blue) / upload (orange), in Mbps"
msgstr "下载（蓝）/ 上传（橙），单位 Mbps"

msgid "System usage"
msgstr "系统使用率"

msgid "CPU (red) / memory (purple), in %"
msgstr "CPU（红）/ 内存（紫），单位 %"

msgid "Device temperature and fan"
msgstr "设备温度与风扇"

msgid "CPU (red) / Wi-Fi (blue) / modem (orange), in °C; fan (green), in %"
msgstr "CPU（红）/ Wi-Fi（蓝）/ 模组（橙），单位 °C；风扇（绿），单位 %"

msgid "Network latency"
msgstr "网络延迟"

msgid "Aliyun (green) / Tencent (blue), in ms"
msgstr "阿里云（绿）/ 腾讯云（蓝），单位 ms"

msgid "5G signal"
msgstr "5G 信号"

msgid "RSRP (red) / RSRQ (orange) / SINR (green), in dB/dBm"
msgstr "RSRP（红）/ RSRQ（橙）/ SINR（绿），单位 dB/dBm"

msgid "Please select valid start and end times."
msgstr "请选择有效的开始和结束时间。"

msgid "Querying…"
msgstr "正在查询…"

msgid "%s samples shown"
msgstr "显示 %s 个采样点"

msgid "Query failed"
msgstr "查询失败"

msgid "Query"
msgstr "查询"

msgid "Last hour"
msgstr "最近1小时"

msgid "CPE Monitor · History"
msgstr "CPE 监控 · 历史查询"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

msgid "End"
msgstr "结束"

msgid "CPE Monitor Settings"
msgstr "CPE 监控设置"

msgid "The collection service restarts automatically after saving and applying."
msgstr "保存并应用后，采集服务会自动重启。"

msgid "Monitor settings"
msgstr "监控设置"

msgid "Collection"
msgstr "采集设置"

msgid "Monthly quota"
msgstr "月流量与额度控制"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "WAN device"
msgstr "WAN 设备"

msgid "Select an existing network device to avoid typing mistakes."
msgstr "从当前系统网络设备中选择，避免手工输入错误。"

msgid "Base sampling interval (s)"
msgstr "基础采样间隔（秒）"

msgid "Modem sampling interval (s)"
msgstr "模组采样间隔（秒）"

msgid "Persistence interval (s)"
msgstr "持久化间隔（秒）"

msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "保留天数"

msgid "Persistent data directory"
msgstr "持久数据目录"

msgid "Aliyun probe host"
msgstr "阿里云探测地址"

msgid "Tencent probe host"
msgstr "腾讯云探测地址"

msgid "Ping count per probe"
msgstr "每次 Ping 包数"

msgid "Ping timeout (s)"
msgstr "Ping 超时（秒）"

msgid "Live speed unit"
msgstr "实时速率显示单位"

msgid "Enable monthly quota limit"
msgstr "开启月度额度限制"

msgid "Counted as download + upload combined; throttled at the threshold, WAN paused at 100%. LAN management stays reachable."
msgstr "按下载＋上传合计计量；达到阈值限速，100% 暂停 WAN 联网，局域网管理仍可访问。"

msgid "Confirm before enabling traffic limiting"
msgstr "开启流量限制前请确认"

msgid "Local statistics may differ from the carrier bill; sampling interval, sudden power loss, protocol overhead and previously unrecorded traffic all affect accuracy. Throttling or blocking may trigger early or late and cannot serve as billing basis."
msgstr "本机统计与运营商账单可能存在偏差；采样间隔、突然断电、协议开销和未记录的历史流量都会影响结果。限速或断网可能提前或延后触发，不能作为运营商计费依据。"

msgid "Enabling pauses HNAT hardware acceleration so rules take effect, which may lower peak performance. Download throttling cannot retract traffic already received by the modem. Please leave quota headroom; the limit can be lifted on the monitor page until the period ends."
msgstr "开启后暂停 HNAT 硬件加速以保证规则生效，峰值性能可能降低。下载限速也不能撤回已经到达模组的流量。请留出额度余量；可随时在监控页解除到本期结束。"

msgid "I understand, enable anyway"
msgstr "了解偏差，继续开启"

msgid "Please acknowledge the accuracy notice first"
msgstr "请先确认统计偏差提示"

msgid "Traffic quota per period (GB)"
msgstr "每期流量额度（GB）"

msgid "Positive integer; 1 GB = 1,000,000,000 bytes, download + upload combined."
msgstr "正整数；1 GB = 1,000,000,000 字节，下载＋上传合计。"

msgid "Throttle at this percentage"
msgstr "达到多少百分比开始限速"

msgid "Download speed after throttling (Mbps)"
msgstr "限速后下载速度（Mbps）"

msgid "Upload speed after throttling (Mbps)"
msgstr "限速后上传速度（Mbps）"

msgid "Billing day of month"
msgstr "每月账单起始日"

msgid "Defaults to midnight on the 1st of each month, in router local time. Only traffic actually recorded by the plugin is counted; totals are re-aggregated after the billing day changes."
msgstr "默认每月 1 日零点；按路由器本地时间计算。仅统计插件实际记录的流量，账单周期变化后重新汇总。"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Not connected / unreadable"
msgstr "未连接 / 无法读取"

msgid "Unknown / not reported"
msgstr "未知 / 接口未报告"

msgid "No sample"
msgstr "未采样"

msgid "No band records in the selected period; data from before the update cannot be reconstructed."
msgstr "所选时间段暂无频段记录；更新前的数据无法补算。"

msgid "Too many records; only the last 5000 observations are shown. Narrow the query range."
msgstr "记录较多，仅展示最近 5000 次观察；请缩短查询范围。"

msgid "Band / network mode changes"
msgstr "频段 / 网络模式变化记录"

msgid "No changes between consecutive valid samples observed in this range."
msgstr "此范围内没有观察到连续有效采样之间的变化。"

msgid "Only serving carriers reported by the interface are recorded; this does not represent all bands supported by the modem or the full aggregation set. The last valid bands are kept when reading fails; grey means no valid information or no sample. Switch times are detection times, so brief switches may be missed. At most the latest 100 changes are shown."
msgstr "仅记录接口报告的在用载波，不代表模组全部支持频段或完整聚合组合。读取失败时沿用上次有效频段；灰色为尚无有效信息或未采样。切换时间为采样发现时间，短暂切换可能漏记。最多显示最近 100 条变化。"

msgid "Bands in use history"
msgstr "在用频段历史"

msgid "Traffic start date"
msgstr "流量开始日期"

msgid "Traffic end date"
msgstr "流量结束日期"

msgid "Daily upload, download and total traffic chart"
msgstr "每日上传、下载及总流量折线图"

msgid "Move the mouse or touch the chart to inspect daily traffic"
msgstr "移动鼠标或轻触图表查看每日流量"

msgid "Traffic (GB)"
msgstr "流量（GB）"

msgid "%s days shown (today counts up to now)"
msgstr "显示 %s 天记录（今天为截至当前的累计量）"

msgid "No records in this range"
msgstr "此时间范围暂无记录"

msgid "Please select valid dates"
msgstr "请选择有效日期"

msgid "Start date must not be after end date"
msgstr "开始日期不能晚于结束日期"

msgid "Last month"
msgstr "最近一个月"

msgid "Invalid action"
msgstr "无效操作"

msgid "Quota, threshold, rates and billing day must be positive integers"
msgstr "额度、阈值、速率和账单日必须为正整数"

msgid "Quota parameters are out of range"
msgstr "额度控制参数超出有效范围"

msgid "Select a dedicated WAN device; LAN devices cannot be limited"
msgstr "请选择独立的 WAN 设备，不能限制局域网设备"

msgid "Disable firewall software/hardware flow offloading first, or quota control may be bypassed"
msgstr "请先关闭防火墙的软件/硬件流量分载，否则额度控制可能被绕过"

msgid "Unable to disable HNAT hardware acceleration"
msgstr "无法关闭 HNAT 硬件加速"

msgid "Another QoS queue exists on WAN; disable other shaping plugins first"
msgstr "WAN 已有其他 QoS 队列，请先停用其他限速插件"

msgid "Another ingress QoS rule exists on WAN"
msgstr "WAN 已有其他入站 QoS 规则"

msgid "Cannot create download shaping device; please install kmod-ifb"
msgstr "无法创建下载限速设备，请安装 kmod-ifb"

msgid "Failed to apply shaping rules; check tc and scheduler modules"
msgstr "限速规则应用失败，请检查 tc 和调度模块"

msgid "Failed to apply blocking rules; check nftables"
msgstr "断网规则应用失败，请检查 nftables"
